[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814939818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105515#issuecomment-2814939818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105515","id":2814939818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nyJKq","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T08:44:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T08:44:01Z","body":"I wouldn't use [`workspace/didDeleteFiles`](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_didDeleteFiles) and [`workspace/didRenameFiles`](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_didRenameFiles) for this. Instead this should be done using [`workspace/willRenameFiles`](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_willRenameFiles) and [`workspace/willDeleteFiles`](https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_willDeleteFiles). Those can provide the client with additional `WorkspaceEdit`s. This way the client will rename both files and is directly aware of the change instead of requiring file system scanning. Also it ensures that both renames happen as close to each other as possible (or even atomic if the system and client support it). This is important, since it reduces the risk of the Godot editor picking up one change by file system scanning but not the other, which would lead Godot to create a new uid file while removing the old one.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2814939818/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815435000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105515#issuecomment-2815435000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105515","id":2815435000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n0CD4","user":{"login":"Cretezy","id":2672503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzI1MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2672503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy","html_url":"https://github.com/Cretezy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cretezy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users